merge(nina): A2 lessons 01-02 + shared component updates

Merge origin/nina (a16a57e) into master via nina-merge branch.

Phase 2 decisions applied:
- KEEP all 13 reviewed files (types.ts, ui.ts, ExerciseRenderer, IllustratedCards,
  Dialogues, DialogueBuilder, FillInBlank, WorkbookFillBlank, ImageLabeling, tts.ts,
  generate-tts.ts, the 2 one-off scripts)
- POLISH GrammarWithExamples.tsx: removed heuristic auto-detection of centered
  layout; now triggered only by explicit `layout: 'centered'` (safer for A1)
- POLISH scripts/generate-tts.ts: restored `usePro ? GEMINI_PROMPT : GEMINI_WORD_PROMPT`
  for vocabulary, so A1 IDs kiselo-mlyako/otset keep the sentence-style prompt
- DELETE .cursor/rules/nina-permissions.mdc (replaced by nina-a2.mdc on master)

Conflict resolutions:
- src/content/a2/index.ts: kept Philip's canonical A2 syllabus structure
  (11 lessons incl. a2-lesson-00 Преговор A1, 6 tests), uncommented loader
  entries for the two completed lessons (a2-lesson-01, a2-lesson-02),
  populated A2_LESSON_EXERCISE_COUNTS with 26 and 45 respectively.
- src/content/shared/types.ts: kept both sides' additive optional fields
  (hideHeader + prominentSubtitle; body_diagram + textOnly;
  image-bubbles + columnSplitAt/hideSentenceNumbers/columnLabels/images/headerImages).
- src/components/exercises/Dialogues.tsx: rewrote to combine master's
  pause/resume audio + tri-state button (Listen/Pause/Continue) + multi-image
  top row with Nina's scene layout + SpeechBubble component. Shared helpers
  renderSectionButton + renderLineList power both paths.
- src/components/exercises/ExerciseRenderer.tsx: combined master's
  grammarHighlight before/after positioning + prominentSubtitle +
  empty-title hide with Nina's hideHeader instruction-only path.
- src/components/exercises/IllustratedCards.tsx: kept Nina's CardItem alias
  and body_diagram early-return, used master's getIllustratedCardSpokenText
  helper for handleCardClick.
- src/components/exercises/WorkbookFillBlank.tsx: combined Nina's
  image-bubbles layout + headerImages + contextText with master's
  columnSplitAt/hideSentenceNumbers/columnLabels/images. renderSentence
  signature switched to options object to support both compact (Nina) and
  displayNum (master).
- scripts/generate-tts.ts: kept Nina's version (preserves A2 audio pipeline
  + her per-card customizations). Master's A1 prompt strategy refactor can
  be cherry-picked later without affecting on-disk MP3s.

Verified: 0 lint errors across merged files. a2-lesson-01/02 use
`layout: 'centered'` explicitly where needed. A1 dialogue/grammar exercises
do NOT set displayLayout/body_diagram/freeTextBlocks/image-bubbles, so
they take their original code paths.

Browser verification pending (Philip).
